<mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">}</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>s</mi><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we substitute these back into our transformed differential equation:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"94\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 22.404em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-al